+
+Includes:
+ + matN and matNxM (rectangular) matrix types
+ + Matrix-Matrix and Matrix-Vector arithmetic
+   - Constant, uniform and shader in inputs
+ + Matrix constructors
+   - From scalar(s)
+   - From other matrices
